        }
      }
    },
    "Leaving home can only be noticed if iOS may check your location in the background. Pick “Always” when asked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "مش هنعرف إنك خرجت غير لو النظام يقدر يشوف موقعك في الخلفية. اختار ”دايمًا“ لما يسألك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set home": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حدد البيت"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stand at home and tap Set — the reminder fires when you leave this spot.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "وانت في البيت دوس حدد — التنبيه هيجي لما تسيب المكان ده."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حدد"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Armed — you'll be reminded when you leave home": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "جاهز — هنفكرك لما تخرج من البيت"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves home after": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يحسب إنك خرجت بعد"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move home to where I am now": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "خلي البيت مكاني الحالي"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminding you daily instead": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "هنفكرك كل يوم بدل كده"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location is set to “while using the app”, which cannot notice you leaving. Allow it always for that.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الموقع مضبوط على ”أثناء استخدام التطبيق“، وده مش بيعرف إنك خرجت. اسمح بيه دايمًا للميزة دي."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remind me at": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "فكرني الساعة"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't let me forget": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "متنساش"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you forget?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بتنسى إيه؟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the usual suspects, or type your own below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "دوس على اللي بتنساه كتير، أو اكتب حاجتك تحت."
